      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Going by what you've described, my working impression is episodes of low blood sugar related to diabetes treatment. I want a home sugar diary done, that's for hypoglycaemia. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Blood tests is what I'd like next, for low sugar. Never skip meals when you take the sugar tablet, and keep glucose tablets or juice with you.",
